   439                          ;
   440                          ;   Format a file name (convert * to '?', etc.). On return,
   441                          ; (A)=0 is an unambigeous name was specified. Enter with (A) equal to
   442                          ; the position within the fcb for the name (either 0 or 16).
   443                          ;
